  "summary": "Rabat is the capital of Morocco, on the Atlantic coast beside the Bou Regreg river and facing Salé. The Almohad ruler Yaʿqub al-Mansur built a city on the site of an earlier ribat and called it Ribat al-Fath; UNESCO dates its oldest parts to the 12th century. The French made it capital in 1912.",
